The initial resource thresholds and budgets are derived from the Qwiper
application. They are configurable heuristics, not benchmark findings.
The package is an independent extraction; no private application history
or business services are included.

Flutter and Dart are upstream dependencies. The example's platform scaffolding
was generated with the Flutter SDK. Upstream dependencies retain their own
licenses. The library has no runtime dependency beyond the Flutter SDK. The example
additionally includes cupertino_icons for Flutter platform-adaptive glyphs;
its license remains applicable.
